# Locales

Procedure: @.claude/skills/add-i18n-key/SKILL.md

- Any add, rename, reword, or removal in `src/_locales/en/messages.json` gets the same,
  properly translated change in `de`, `es`, `nl`, `fi`, `hi`, `pl`, and `ru`.
- Edit the files as text. Never round-trip a `messages.json` through a JSON serializer —
  placeholder formatting differs per file and a reserialize rewrites every key.
- `src/_locales` is excluded from Prettier on purpose; don't format it.
